Discover refined family living in the heart of Dundarave. This beautifully maintained 4-bedroom, 3-bathroom residence offers timeless charm, a functional two-level layout, and a private manicured garden—perfect for families seeking comfort, space, and one of West Vancouver’s most desirable neighborhoods.

Ideally located just a short walk to the West Vancouver Seawalk, West Vancouver Community Centre, École Pauline Johnson Elementary School, West Vancouver Secondary School, Kay Meek Arts Centre, Irwin Park, shops, restaurants, transit, and everyday conveniences.

The main level features a welcoming formal living room, elegant dining room, bright kitchen with breakfast nook, sunken family room, laundry room, guest bedroom, and a full bathroom—ideal for extended family or visitors. Upstairs offers three spacious bedrooms and two bathrooms, including a comfortable primary retreat.

Enjoy partial ocean views, mature landscaping, and a warm, inviting atmosphere throughout. A rare opportunity to lease an exceptional home in one of West Vancouver’s most prestigious seaside communities.

